    "Description": "Access Control Lists (ACLs) are used to define fine-grained discretionary access rights for files and directories. The acl packages contain the getfacl and setfacl utilities needed for manipulating access control lists.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* acl: Symlink traversal privilege escalation via libacl functions (CVE-2026-54369)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
